OL,3,GNEWSAMaserati driver who killed woman
OL,4,Ain crash given suspended sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Maserati driver who killed a woman
OL,7,Fand seriously injured two others has
OL,8,Fbeen given a suspended prison sentence.
OL,10,FRonald Dowling, 66, overtook a vehicle
OL,11,Fin heavy rain before aquaplaning,
OL,12,Fskidding across the carriageway and
OL,13,Fhitting Sharon Berry's car in the fatal
OL,14,Fcrash at New Inn, Pontypool, on 26
OL,15,FOctober 2023.
OL,17,FHis wife, Kim Dowling, was left
OL,18,Fparalysed, and passenger Jane Beedell
OL,19,Falso suffered extensive injuries.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
