OL,3,GNEWSAMaserati driver who killed woman
OL,4,Ain crash given suspended sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowling, who previously pleaded guilty
OL,7,Fto causing death and serious injury by
OL,8,Fcareless driving, was sentenced to 27
OL,9,Fmonths in prison, suspended for two
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
